      "notes": "Only a total of two courses from the special studies (ETHN 197, 198, 199) will be counted in fulfillment of the elective requirement. ETHN 189 may be repeated three times for credit toward major requirements when topics vary. ETHN 100H and ETHN 196H (honors) count toward the ten electives."
